	(text "Shifts toward the Pico. H = board-present marker (always 1), G = footswitch,\nF..A = spare inputs IN1..IN6. All inputs active low, 3.3 V max.\nR4 pulls the chain input low, so the bytes after the last module read 0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 38 0)
