	(text "LED: common anode only, anode on 5V. Series resistors give about 5 mA per channel:\n  red (5 - 2.0 - 0.1) / 560 = 5.2 mA, green/blue (5 - 3.1 - 0.1) / 390 = 4.6 mA.\nBase resistors: (3.3 - 0.7) / 4k7 = 0.55 mA, so Q1-Q3 saturate (Vce about 0.1 V).\nQ1-Q3: 2N2222A / PN2222A in TO-92, pins E-B-C. Check the pinout of the parts you buy."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 290 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38355811-4561-4226-abe0-80a3e6f99dbe")
	)
